        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "因为 $u=-e_i$，则线圈两端的电压可以这样求出：$u=-L\\omega I_м\\sin\\omega t=L\\omega I_м\\cos\\left(\\omega t+\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right)$ $=U_м\\cos\\left(\\omega t+\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right)$ （2.30）",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 58,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0068#6"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "其中 $U_м=L\\omega I_м$ 是电压振幅的大小.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 58,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0068#7"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "因此，**线圈上电压的振荡比电流强度振荡超前** $\\frac{\\pi}{2}$. 或者也可以这样说，**电流强度振荡比电压振荡滞后** $\\frac{\\pi}{2}$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 58,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0068#8"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "当线圈上的电压达到最大值时，电流强度等于零（图 42）.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 58,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0068#9"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "fig",
          "text": "",
          "id": "fig-42",
          "label": "图 42",
          "printed_page": 59,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0069#1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "cap",
          "text": "图 42",
          "id": null,
          "label": "图 42",
          "printed_page": 59,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0069#2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "当电压变为零时，电流强度的绝对值达到最大值.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 59,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0069#3"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "在线圈里电流强度的振幅等于$I_м=\\frac{U_м}{\\omega L}$ （2.31）",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 59,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0069#4"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "如果引入符号$\\omega L=X_L$ （2.32）用有效值代替电流强度和电压的振幅，则可得$I=\\frac{U}{X_L}$ （2.33）",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 59,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0069#5"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "**■ $X_L$ 即角频率和自感系数的乘积叫做感抗.**",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 59,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0069#6"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "根据公式（2.33），电流强度的有效值与电压的有效值和感抗间的关系与直流电路中的欧姆定律类似.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 59,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0069#7"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "**感抗与频率有关**. 稳恒电流一般“不能察觉”线圈的电感.在 $\\omega=0$ 时，**感抗 $X_L=0$**. 电压变化越快，自感电动势就越大，**电流的振幅就越小**.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 59,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0069#8"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  },
